The '''Honor of Kings Invitational Midseason 2024''' was the Midseason major for [[Honor of Kings]] in 2024, features 12 best teams during the 1st half of 2024. The tournament will also debuting '''KPL Dream Team''' a special All-Star team as a sole representative of China and the [[King Pro League]] in this tournament. The tournament was announced as part of the '''Esports World Cup''' line-up on February 19, 2024.<ref name="EWC HOK">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/ESWCgg/status/1759533291407913323|title=#Shenzhen, help us make this our biggest announcement yet|date=2024-02-19|author=Esports World Cup|language={{FlagNoLink|usuk}} English}}</ref>

{{heroIcon|allain|size=24px}} '''Allain - Heavenblade''' was the commemorative skin for KIM 2024, which can be found in the skin shop.
