===Format===
* '''Group Stage''' - ''August 1<sup>st</sup> and 2<sup>nd</sup>''
** 12 teams will be split into 2 groups of 6
*** {{team|KPL Dream Team}} and {{team|LGD Gaming MY}} will be split into different groups as seeded teams.
** Single Round-robin {{Abbr/Bo1}} for each group
** <span class="bg-up>Top 4 teams from each group</span> qualify for the knockout stages.
* '''Playoffs''' - ''August 3<sup>rd</sup> and 4<sup>th</sup>''
** Single Elimination Bracket
*** Group winners may chose their opponent among the 3rd/4th placed teams from the other group.
** Quarterfinals is {{Abbr/Bo3}},
** Semifinals & Finals are {{Abbr/Bo5}}.
** Side selection for Game 1 is decided by coin flip, subsequently, loser pick sides.

